# starters/vertical/.cut -- which paths of the full site this starter is
# cut from make up site/.
# One path per line, relative to the full site's root. A directory copies
# recursively. Regenerate from the root of this repository with:
#   scripts/cut-starter.sh <path-to-the-full-site> vertical
#
# Selection rationale: see README.md beside this file. Only works whose
# images have clear reuse terms are listed. Edits a mechanical cut cannot
# infer live in fixups.sh instead of here.

# moss's own scaffold gitignores, identical between the full site and the
# starter -- not build output, just checked-in convention.
.moss/.gitignore

# site config (domain + [channels.email] dropped by cut-starter.sh)
.moss/config.toml

# theme, whole directory
.moss/theme

# home page and chronology. The home page's own cover and featured list name
# pages and images that are not in this cut; fixups.sh repoints them.
八大山人.md
年表.md

# 文 (writings): folder index, the 河上花歌 with its four Commons images, the
# letter to 石濤 and three of the thirteen letters as text pages. The letters'
# scans are left out (fixups.sh removes their image embeds); their texts
# read complete without them. The series index page's sort: list is pruned to
# match by scripts/prune-sort-lists.py.
文/文.md
文/河上花歌.md
文/河上花歌_1.jpg
文/河上花歌_2.jpg
文/河上花歌_3.jpg
文/河上花歌_4.jpg
文/與石濤書.md
文/致方士琯十三札/致方士琯十三札.md
文/致方士琯十三札/專使促駕.md
文/致方士琯十三札/只手少甦.md
文/致方士琯十三札/窮變得意處.md

# 書 (calligraphy): the 蘭亭序 (Metropolitan Museum of Art Open Access) and its
# cover crop
書/書.md
書/蘭亭序.md
書/蘭亭序.jpg
書/蘭亭序_cover.jpg

# 畫 (paintings): folder index and the works whose images carry clear reuse
# terms: Metropolitan Museum of Art Open Access (山水冊, 荷花禽鳥圖, 雙鷹圖),
# National Palace Museum Open Data, CC BY 4.0 (傳綮寫生冊), and Wikimedia
# Commons files tagged PD-Art (河上花圖, 魚石圖卷)
畫/畫.md
畫/山水冊.md
畫/山水冊.jpg
畫/荷花禽鳥圖.md
